; A sample Raskell program whose value is a FUNCTION. It needs Stage 1 (*).
;
; When a program's value is a function, the file runner applies it to each
; number on the command line, and prints each result. Run it with:
;     ./rask --file programs/square.rask 3 12
; It prints 9, then 144. (Before Stage 1 it gives an error. Try it with
; rask-reference in place of ./rask to see it work now.)
(lambda (n)
  (* n n))
